      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 3.6 Release Schedule",
      "source_hash": 10074235114432173115,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "Python 3.6 릴리스 일정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532265Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 17489366501046199154,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532269Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This document describes the development and release schedule for Python 3.6.",
      "source_hash": 7357929741144109898,
      "context_hash": 4441648796028552222,
      "translation": "이 문서는 Python 3.6의 개발 및 릴리스 일정을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532269Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The schedule primarily concerns itself with PEP-sized items.",
      "source_hash": 8496237367836649166,
      "context_hash": 18021660702505331570,
      "translation": "이 일정은 주로 PEP 규모의 항목을 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532270Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Release Manager and Crew",
      "source_hash": 17437471849611441175,
      "context_hash": 17307302051623918963,
      "translation": "릴리스 관리자 및 담당자",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532270Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "3.6 Release Manager: Ned Deily",
      "source_hash": 11001837212364617245,
      "context_hash": 16931721154163718027,
      "translation": "3.6 릴리스 관리자: Ned Deily",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532271Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Windows installers: Steve Dower",
      "source_hash": 2962025219427909861,
      "context_hash": 11667908036032819634,
      "translation": "Windows 설치 프로그램: Steve Dower",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532271Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Mac installers: Ned Deily",
      "source_hash": 11610667401787003816,
      "context_hash": 13178087952209840564,
      "translation": "Mac 설치 프로그램: Ned Deily",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532271Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Documentation: Julien Palard, Georg Brandl",
      "source_hash": 4417628884433896942,
      "context_hash": 3575439586898670892,
      "translation": "문서화: Julien Palard, Georg Brandl",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "3.6 Lifespan",
      "source_hash": 10543790489292007022,
      "context_hash": 10977174092937098338,
      "translation": "3.6 수명 주기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "3.6 will receive `bugfix updates <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#maintenance-branches>`_ approximately every 3 months for about 24 months.",
      "source_hash": 7875971052016993057,
      "context_hash": 9262301024389898496,
      "translation": "3.6은 약 24개월 동안 약 3개월마다 `bugfix updates <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#maintenance-branches>`_\\ 를 받습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Sometime after the release of 3.7.0 final, a final 3.6 bugfix update will be released.",
      "source_hash": 14964456457344832348,
      "context_hash": 7445420936162414930,
      "translation": "3.7.0 최종 릴리스 이후 어느 시점에 3.6의 최종 버그 수정 업데이트가 릴리스됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532273Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "After that, it is expected that `security updates <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#security-branches>`_ (source only) will be released as needed until 5 years after the release of 3.6 final, so until approximately 2021-12.",
      "source_hash": 17774533677013448190,
      "context_hash": 13607441508524201670,
      "translation": "그 후에는 3.6 최종 릴리스 후 5년이 될 때까지, 즉 대략 2021-12까지 필요에 따라 `security updates <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#security-branches>`_ (소스만)가 릴리스될 것으로 예상됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532273Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "As of 2021-12-23, 3.6 has reached the `end-of-life phase <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#end-of-life-branches>`_ of its release cycle. 3.6.15 was the final security release.",
      "source_hash": 13984183868635518509,
      "context_hash": 1603538072475634783,
      "translation": "2021-12-23 기준으로 3.6은 릴리스 주기의 `end-of-life phase <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#end-of-life-branches>`_\\ 에 도달했습니다. 3.6.15가 최종 보안 릴리스였습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532273Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The code base for 3.6 is now frozen and no further updates will be provided nor issues of any kind will be accepted on the bug tracker.",
      "source_hash": 2244688012658308068,
      "context_hash": 5167165094800117330,
      "translation": "3.6의 코드 베이스는 이제 동결되며 더 이상의 업데이트는 제공되지 않고 버그 추적기에서 어떠한 종류의 이슈도 접수되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:39.532274Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
